---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Adventure Kits Access | Sign Up to Unlock the Online Kit
description: Sign up once to get quarterly Adventure Kits activities your kids can do at home, plus future kit announcements.
permalink: /adventure-kits/index.html
---
<style>
  .adventure-page {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: #173042;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 12% 2%, rgba(101, 206, 214, 0.30), transparent 26%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 84% 8%, rgba(132, 181, 255, 0.28), transparent 24%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #f5fdff 0%, #eff8ff 36%, #eaf6f5 100%);
  }

  .adventure-page::before,
  .adventure-page::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 999px;
    pointer-events: none;
    filter: blur(18px);
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  .adventure-page::before {
    top: 5rem;
    right: -8rem;
    width: 16rem;
    height: 16rem;
    background: rgba(74, 190, 220, 0.30);
  }

  .adventure-page::after {
    bottom: 9rem;
    left: -7rem;
    width: 15rem;
    height: 15rem;
    background: rgba(108, 207, 180, 0.30);
  }

  .adventure-shell {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .adventure-hero {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    align-items: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(23, 48, 66, 0.08);
    border-radius: 2.5rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84);
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    box-shadow: 0 28px 70px -44px rgba(23, 48, 66, 0.38);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  }

  .adventure-hero__copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .adventure-pill,
  .adventure-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    width: fit-content;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.45rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  }

  .adventure-pill {
    background: rgba(74, 190, 220, 0.16);
    color: #1f5f72;
  }

  .adventure-badge {
    background: rgba(23, 48, 66, 0.08);
    color: #173042;
  }

  .adventure-hero h2,
  .adventure-section h2,
  .adventure-card h3 {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .adventure-hero h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4.75rem);
    color: #173042;
    max-width: 12ch;
  }

  .adventure-hero p,
  .adventure-section p {
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #4b6170;
  }

  .adventure-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .adventure-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.95rem 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    transition: transform 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease, background-color 180ms ease;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 30px -20px rgba(23, 48, 66, 0.38);
  }

  .adventure-btn--primary {
    background: #4abedc;
    color: #173042;
  }

  .adventure-btn--secondary {
    background: #84b5ff;
    color: #173042;
  }

  .adventure-btn--ghost {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
    color: #173042;
    border: 1px solid rgba(23, 48, 66, 0.12);
  }

  .adventure-btn:hover,
  .adventure-btn:focus-visible {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 22px 34px -22px rgba(23, 48, 66, 0.55);
    outline: none;
  }

  .adventure-showcase {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .adventure-showcase__frame {
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(23, 48, 66, 0.08);
    background: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 40px -32px rgba(23, 48, 66, 0.48);
  }

  .adventure-showcase__frame img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(220px, 40vw, 380px);
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .adventure-stats {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .adventure-stat {
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(23, 48, 66, 0.08);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84);
    padding: 1rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .adventure-stat strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #173042;
  }

  .adventure-stat span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #6b7b87;
  }

  .adventure-section {
    margin-top: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 5rem);
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    border-radius: 2.25rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(23, 48, 66, 0.08);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 48px -38px rgba(23, 48, 66, 0.40);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  }

  .adventure-section.teal {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(74, 190, 220, 0.28) 0%, rgba(132, 181, 255, 0.30) 100%);
  }

  .adventure-section.mint {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(108, 207, 180, 0.24) 0%, rgba(74, 190, 220, 0.20) 100%);
  }

  .adventure-section h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: #173042;
  }

  .adventure-grid,
  .adventure-steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .adventure-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  }

  .adventure-step {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84);
    border-radius: 1.75rem;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(23, 48, 66, 0.08);
  }

  .adventure-step__icon {
    flex: none;
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #4abedc;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 18px -12px rgba(23, 48, 66, 0.35);
  }

  .adventure-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 1.75rem;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 38px -30px rgba(23, 48, 66, 0.40);
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .adventure-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: #173042;
  }

  .adventure-footer {
    margin-top: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 5rem);
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    border-radius: 2rem;
    background: #173042;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .adventure-footer h2 {
    color: #84b5ff;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .adventure-hero {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(320px, 0.95fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .adventure-steps {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .adventure-btn {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="adventure-page">
  <div class="adventure-shell container py-10 md:py-14">
    <section id="adventure-kits-signup" class="adventure-section teal" data-reveal data-adventure-kits-gate>
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
        <span class="adventure-badge bg-white/75">Access required</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-slate-900 normal-case tracking-tight">A hands-on kit for kids and parents</h1>
        <p class="adventure-section__lead">Sign up once and we’ll send quarterly Adventure Kits activities your kids can do at home, along with future kit announcements for your family.</p>
      </div>
      {% set accessFormId = 'adventureKitsAccessForm' %}
      {% set accessStatusId = 'adventureKitsAccessStatus' %}
      {% include "partials/adventure-kits-access-form.njk" %}
    </section>

    <div data-adventure-kits-content hidden>
      <section class="adventure-hero" data-reveal>
        <div class="adventure-hero__copy">
          <span class="adventure-pill">
            <span aria-hidden="true">🧭</span>
            Family activity series
          </span>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <h2>Explore Adventure Kits with your family</h2>
            <p class="max-w-2xl">Adventure Kits gives parents a simple way to bring home a ready-made activity each quarter so kids can try new ideas, practice problem-solving, and have fun together.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="adventure-actions">
            <a class="adventure-btn adventure-btn--primary" href="#adventure-kits-signup">Sign up now</a>
            <a class="adventure-btn adventure-btn--ghost" href="#what-it-is">What you get</a>
            <a class="adventure-btn adventure-btn--secondary" href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}">Email the team</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="adventure-showcase">
          <div class="adventure-showcase__frame">
            <img src="/assets/img/programs/adventure_kits.jpg" alt="Guard youth holding adventure kits during a community event" width="1920" height="1005" loading="eager" decoding="async">
          </div>
          <div class="adventure-stats">
            <div class="adventure-stat">
              <strong>Seasonal</strong>
              <span>Fresh kits</span>
            </div>
            <div class="adventure-stat">
              <strong>Family</strong>
              <span>Hands-on</span>
            </div>
            <div class="adventure-stat">
              <strong>Online</strong>
              <span>Easy access</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section id="what-it-is" class="adventure-section" data-reveal>
        <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
          <span class="adventure-badge bg-white/75">Inside the kit</span>
          <h2>What are Adventure Kits?</h2>
          <p class="adventure-section__lead">Adventure Kits bring Guard families together with short, guided activities you can open at home. Each quarterly release blends creativity, healthy habits, and learning into something kids can do with a parent or caregiver.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="adventure-grid">
          <article class="adventure-card">
            <span class="adventure-step__icon" aria-hidden="true">🎨</span>
            <h3>Create together</h3>
            <p>Kids get a project they can complete with a grown-up, which keeps the activity social and easy to finish.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="adventure-card">
            <span class="adventure-step__icon" aria-hidden="true">📘</span>
            <h3>Guided and simple</h3>
            <p>Every kit is built to be low-prep and family-friendly, so parents don’t have to build the experience from scratch.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="adventure-card">
            <span class="adventure-step__icon" aria-hidden="true">💬</span>
            <h3>Conversation-ready</h3>
            <p>The activities create natural moments to talk about goals, resilience, and what it means to be part of a Guard family.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="how-it-works" class="adventure-section mint" data-reveal>
        <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
          <span class="adventure-badge bg-white/75">How it works</span>
          <h2>Sign up once, then watch for quarterly activities</h2>
          <p class="adventure-section__lead">Families complete one simple signup form. After that, we’ll send quarterly activities your kids can do at home and keep you updated on new kits.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="adventure-steps">
          <div class="adventure-step">
            <span class="adventure-step__icon" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Complete the sign-up form</h3>
              <p>Tell us who you are and how to reach you so we can keep your family on the list.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="adventure-step">
            <span class="adventure-step__icon" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">We save your interest</h3>
              <p>Your sign-up is saved once, and we’ll use it for future quarterly kits.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="adventure-step">
            <span class="adventure-step__icon" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Open the kit experience</h3>
              <p>Once unlocked, you can revisit the page and continue using the kit content from the same browser.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="adventure-step">
            <span class="adventure-step__icon" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Stay on the list</h3>
              <p>We’ll use the same signup path for future quarterly Adventure Kits and related announcements.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="adventure-section" data-reveal>
        <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
          <span class="adventure-badge bg-white/75">What families get</span>
          <h2>Built to feel easy, useful, and worth the click</h2>
          <p class="adventure-section__lead">Adventure Kits are designed for busy families. The goal is to send a short, meaningful activity each quarter that feels practical to start and easy to finish.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="adventure-grid">
          <article class="adventure-card">
            <h3>Family-friendly activities</h3>
            <p>Quick, guided projects that parents can run with their kids at home.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="adventure-card">
            <h3>Future kit updates</h3>
            <p>Use the signup to stay on the list for quarterly Adventure Kits activities that arrive at home.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="adventure-card">
            <h3>Same secure signup path</h3>
            <p>One sign-up keeps your family on the list for future activity releases.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="adventure-card">
            <h3>Easy to revisit</h3>
            <p>Once you sign up from this browser, the page remembers your access.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="adventure-footer" data-reveal>
        <h2>Need help getting started?</h2>
        <p>Reach out if you want help using Adventure Kits with your family, a classroom, or a group setting. We’re happy to point you in the right direction.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
